  "reference": "Isaiah 6",
  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the year that king Uzziah died I saw the Lord sitting upon a throne, high and lifted up; and his train filled the temple. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Above him stood the seraphim: each one had six wings; with twain he covered his face, and with twain he covered his feet, and with twain he did fly. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And one cried unto another, and said, Holy, holy, holy, is Jehovah of hosts: the whole earth is full of his glory. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the foundations of the thresholds shook at the voice of him that cried, and the house was filled with smoke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said I, Woe is me! for I am undone; because I am a man of unclean lips, and I dwell in the midst of a people of unclean lips: for mine eyes have seen the King, Jehovah of hosts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then flew one of the seraphim unto me, having a live coal in his hand, which he had taken with the tongs from off the altar: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he touched my mouth with it, and said, Lo, this hath touched thy lips; and thine iniquity is taken away, and thy sin forgiven. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I heard the voice of the Lord, saying, Whom shall I send, and who will go for us? Then I said, Here am I; send me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, Go, and tell this people, Hear ye indeed, but understand not; and see ye indeed, but perceive not. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make the heart of this people fat, and make their ears heavy, and shut their eyes; lest they see with their eyes, and hear with their ears, and understand with their heart, and turn again, and be healed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said I, Lord, how long? And he answered, Until cities be waste without inhabitant, and houses without man, and the land become utterly waste, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Jehovah have removed men far away, and the forsaken places be many in the midst of the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if there be yet a tenth in it, it also shall in turn be eaten up: as a terebinth, and as an oak, whose stock remaineth, when they are felled; so the holy seed is the stock thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
